 "id": "indigo",
 "rules": "- Participation Requirements -\n· Endministrator Authority Level ≥ 30\n\n- Event Rules -\n· During the event, you can select any combination of Test Criteria for the challenge, and try to complete it.\n· Every combat challenge includes 3 waves. Defeat all enemies to succeed. A failed challenge can be restarted, but you cannot continue midway through a challenge.\n· \"Test Criteria\" are a series of effects that make challenges more difficult, and can be divided into 1 / 2 / 3 according to their difficulty level. \"Total Test Criteria\" is the sum of difficulty levels of all Test Criteria selected.\n· Test Criteria are divided into \"Criteria Sets\". Completing challenges with higher \"Total Test Criteria\" will unlock more \"Criteria Sets\".\n· Some Test Criteria are [Locked Criteria] that cannot be selected by default. Select the specified [Key Criteria] to unlock them.\n· Unselecting a [Key Criteria] will also unselect and cache the dependent [Locked Criteria]. Cached criteria will not be activated for the challenge. You must select the required [Key Criteria] to activate them.\n\n- Event Rewards -\n· Complete event missions to earn rewards such as Vitrified Indigos. Completing a Test Criterion for the first time also rewards some Vitrified Indigos.\n· Vitrified Indigos can be spent at the [Secret Sanctuary] for various rewards.\n\n- Sanctuary Rating -\n· [Sanctuary Rating] represents your current best records in terms of \"Total Test Criteria\" and will be displayed in Friends-related screens.\n· Successfully completing a challenge with Total Test Criteria of at least 1 activates [Sanctuary Rating] for the event.\n· [Sanctuary Rating] for this Contingency Contract event will only be active for the duration of the said event.\n\n- Event Updates -\n· After event launch, an update will be applied on day 8 at 12:00 (server time). This adds a new batch of Test Criteria. The new Test Criteria cannot be selected if their Criteria Set is still locked.\n· After the event begins, a new Cycle Mission will be added every 3 days (at 04:00 server time), until all 7 Cycle Missions have been added.\n· All Contract Missions are effective until the end of the event.\n\n- End of the Event -\n· This is a limited-time event and will end at the scheduled time.\n· After the event ends, no more challenges can be attempted. Engraved medal(s) of the event cannot be earned, and mission progress will not be updated.\n· After the event ends, the [Secret Sanctuary] will remain open for a while so that you may exchange the remaining rewards. Once the [Secret Sanctuary] closes, all Vitrified Indigos earned from this event will expire.",
 "feature": "- Enemies include various blightshades, witchcraft creations, feral beasts, and Cangzei pirates such as Cloud Obliterators.\n- You can still apply Vulnerability, Arts Inflictions, Physical Statuses, and Arts Reactions to enemies with shield stacks.",
 "stageRules": "- The operation comprises 3 consecutive enemy waves to fight. Defeat all enemy waves to complete the operation.\n- Healing Masses will be dropped between the waves. Touch them to restore HP to every teammate.\n- There is a resting session between waves, during which the operators are still considered to be in battle.\n- The operation has a countdown timer. Once the timer ends or all operators in the team are reduced to ZERO HP, the operation is interrupted.\n- Tacticals and consumables cannot be used.",
 "recommendLv": 80,
 "timer": null,
 "maxTotal": 55,
 "maxTotalByPhase": {
